[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Honor 6X Landscape
Name[zh_CN]=荣耀畅玩6X 横屏模式
Comment=Restart the graphical session in landscape mode
Comment[zh_CN]=切换横屏、触摸坐标与横屏壁纸，并重新登录桌面
Exec=/usr/bin/honor6x-displayctl landscape
Icon=video-display
Terminal=false
Categories=Settings;HardwareSettings;X-XFCE-SettingsDialog;
OnlyShowIn=XFCE;
